			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 736740301,
					"content": "小傢伙，不是你帶我來的嗎？來點作用，再動一動啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740302,
					"content": "唉，好吧，你就待著別動吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740303,
						736740304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740303,
					"content": "烏爾曼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740305,
					"content": "旅行者？嘿喲，真是好久不見了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740306,
					"content": "#怎麼？{F#妳}{M#你}還在滿世界閒逛嗎？我可是聽說了{F#妳}{M#你}的不少驚天事蹟，{F#妳}{M#你}可真是身手不凡啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740307,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，這次{F#妳}{M#你}來須彌，又是打算來解決什麼問題？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740308,
						736740310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740308,
					"content": "你說點吉利的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740309,
					"content": "行行，說正經的。旅行者，這次我們再合作一下，怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740313,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}看，這片須彌大地，可是處處都是寶藏，哪裡都有摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740314,
					"content": "#我的這個體質嘛…也正常發揮，吸引了不少仙靈過來，裡面也有{F#妳}{M#你}我熟悉無比的「尋寶仙靈」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740315,
					"content": "#還是和之前一樣，{F#妳}{M#你}負責和仙靈去尋寶，我負責給{F#妳}{M#你}準備報酬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740316,
					"content": "只要我們聯手，絕對能再大大地賺上一筆！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740317,
						736740321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740317,
					"content": "這次又要找「鐵錢」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740318,
					"content": "那不是，這次我要找的是比「鐵錢」更值錢的「古鐵錢」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740319,
					"content": "就多了一個字吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740320,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}別小看這一個字啊，多一個字，能多賣不少摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740326,
					"content": "那這件事就這麼定了，我們和之前一樣通力合作，狠狠地再大賺一筆！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740321,
					"content": "除了我，你就找不到別人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740322,
					"content": "哎呀…挑合作夥伴，當然要挑自己最熟悉的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740323,
					"content": "#再說了，{F#妳}{M#你}我朋友一場，有這種好事，我怎麼能讓肥水流外人田呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740324,
